cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, and please also cite the accompanying paper."
title: "HFGAD: Hierarchical Fine-Grained Attention Decoder for Gaze Estimation"
abstract: >-
  Official PyTorch implementation of HFGAD, a lightweight hierarchical
  fine-grained attention decoder for appearance-based gaze estimation.
  HFGAD combines a Multi-Scale Channel-Spatial Attention (MSCSA) module and
  a Selective Fusion Module (SFM) to exploit shallow-layer, fine-grained cues
  that are usually discarded by deep encoder features.
